\description{
Every rblimp plot is a \code{\link[ggplot2:ggplot]{ggplot2::ggplot}}, so you style and save it as you would any
ggplot. This page shows the parts specific to rblimp, using a plot such as
\code{p <- residual_plot(model, 'y', x = 'x')}. The plotting functions themselves are listed
